    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d700">

                <pb facs="0672" n="582" xml:id="pg582"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/711</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Tiflis</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Smith</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tiflis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1917-11-23T15:00:00+02:59"><hi rendition="#italic">November 23,
                                1917, 3 p.m.</hi></date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received November 24, 1 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Saturday I shall be present at the meeting for organization government of
                    Caucasus which will unite with Southern federation and repudiate armistice or a
                    separate peace. Essential to give them financial support as indicated in my
                    telegrams of 9th, 18th. Anxiously awaiting instructions. This aid is requested
                    both by representatives the Provisional Government and commander in chief.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Smith</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
